{"title": "Spikes", "pageid": 39860, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Spikes", "categories": ["Surfaces", "Areas"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"min-height: 200px\" class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Spike_Growth_surface.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8d/Spike_Growth_surface.png/300px-Spike_Growth_surface.png.webp, /w/images/8/8d/Spike_Growth_surface.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Spikes image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8d/Spike_Growth_surface.png/300px-Spike_Growth_surface.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8d/Spike_Growth_surface.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Spikes</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Surface\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Surface\">surface</a> that deals Piercing damage based on how far a creature moves through the spikes.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>Deals <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">2d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Piercing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">Piercing</span></a> damage every time a creature moves on top of the spikes.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/25px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/38px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Condition Type Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/25px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Type: <a href=\"/wiki/Area#Surface\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Area\">Surface</a></dd>\n\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Spike_Growth\"> Condition: Spike Growth </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Spike_Growth_(Condition)\" title=\"Spike Growth (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f4/Spike_Growth_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Spike_Growth_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f4/Spike_Growth_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Spike_Growth_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f4/Spike_Growth_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Spike_Growth_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Spike Growth\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f4/Spike_Growth_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Spike_Growth_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f4/Spike_Growth_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spike_Growth_(Condition)\" title=\"Spike Growth (Condition)\">Spike Growth</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: Whilst on surface</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Take <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">2d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Piercing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">Piercing</span></a> for every 1.5 m (5 ft) moved on the spikes.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Difficult_Terrain\"> Condition: Difficult Terrain </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Difficult_Terrain_(Condition)\" title=\"Difficult Terrain (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Difficult Terrain\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Difficult_Terrain_(Condition)\" title=\"Difficult Terrain (Condition)\">Difficult Terrain</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: Whilst on surface</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Movement_Speed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Movement Speed\">Movement Speed</a> halved</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creation\">Creation</span></h2>\n<p>This area can be created by the following:\n</p><p>\nSpells and actions:\n</p>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r347748\">.mw-parser-output .div-col{margin-top:0.3em;column-width:20em}.mw-parser-output .div-col>ul{list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .div-col-rules{column-rule:1px solid #aaa}.mw-parser-output .div-col dl,.mw-parser-output .div-col ol,.mw-parser-output .div-col ul{margin-top:0}.mw-parser-output .div-col li,.mw-parser-output .div-col dd{page-break-inside:avoid;break-inside:avoid-column}</style><div class=\"div-col\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Spike_Growth\" title=\"Spike Growth\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d4/Spike_Growth_Icon.webp/30px-Spike_Growth_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d4/Spike_Growth_Icon.webp/45px-Spike_Growth_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d4/Spike_Growth_Icon.webp/60px-Spike_Growth_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Spike Growth\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d4/Spike_Growth_Icon.webp/30px-Spike_Growth_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d4/Spike_Growth_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Spike_Growth\" title=\"Spike Growth\">Spike Growth</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Magic:_Spike_Growth\" title=\"Wild Magic: Spike Growth\"><picture